WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.120
Someone once said...

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:55.790
There are flowers with petals that 
look like they're from corn poppy,

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.760
but taste like chicken nuggets...

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.560
Chicorn Poppy Nuggets!

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:10.700
There are okapi made out of colorful 
chocolate with plenty of cocoa...

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:14.740
Cocokapi!

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.210
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:24.750
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:31.090
At last, Toriko and company discovered 
the training ingredient, Meteor Garlic.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.790
They had their fill of Komatsu's cooking 
and the nutrition packed inside.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:41.300
In order to learn the perfect method for 
removing poison from a Poison Potato,

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:46.170
they went off to pay a visit to Joie, 
the personal chef to the king of Jiddal.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.370
I believe the time is right.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.780
Our plan is in its final stage as well.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:57.550
In that case, I suppose 
I shall return, too...

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:02.290
We're comin' in!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.790
Uh... Nobody's here!

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:09.090
It looks like they've left long ago...

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.530
Joie, huh? I wanted to meet him...

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:15.800
Meanwhile,

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.370
a representative from IGO 
went to pick up Setsuno.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:25.240
I know the reason you've come for me.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.350
It seems your president

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:33.850
and the boss of Gourmet Corp. have met!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:41.430
Showdown at the Summit! Ichiryu 
versus Midora of the Gourmet Corp.!

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.030
I heard something, Toriko.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.100
You've been causing trouble again, huh?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:56.210
The market is buzzing with rumors 
about the kingdom of Jiddal.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.510
The story's spread already?

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:00.180
Word travels fast.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:05.120
Rumor has it, since you and the others 
went, the country's become much safer.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:09.320
Match from the Gourmet Mafia stayed 
behind and took over the casino.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:12.690
I'm sure he's gotten all of the 
illegal ingredients out of there.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:14.220
Huh...

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:19.730
Now, I bet that not only Jiddal but Nerg 
will become safe countries to live in.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.930
And how the country's actually being 
governed now that the king disappeared,

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.030
that's a big deal.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:25.740
As for keepin' the streets safe,

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.900
Livebearer's in charge,

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.710
and it looks like he's doin' a bang-up job.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.910
And so you're embarking 
on your next trip, Toriko?

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:38.850
Yep. Except for the next training ingredient,

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:42.180
I wanted to meet Old Man Ichiryu, 
but I guess it wasn't in the cards.

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.050
There it is!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.990
Thanks, Tom!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:49.890
See ya!

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.600
Wait for me, old man!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.170
I'm gettin' back on track with 
capturin' the training ingredients!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.520
I can't believe he would 
stroll in here alone...

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:30.260
I think this is the first time I've 
seen the president of IGO in the flesh.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:31.420
He's an old man!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.430
I'm nervous...

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.060
Kytra...

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.870
You're rude for laughing while saying that!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.950
I'm Dress, the Executive Chef.

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:01.220
So, what do you want?

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.820
Don't worry.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:09.160
I didn't come here to start a fight.

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.060
I just came here to chat...

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.360
...with your boss.

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:20.140
Well, everyone,

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.610
would you mind letting me through?

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:24.910
Just a second, Mr. President.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:30.310
You suddenly show up at our headquarters 
and demand a meeting with the boss?

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:33.080
You don't get to meet the main 
dish without an appointment.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.850
If I made an appointment, I'd be 
able to meet him just like that?

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.420
First,

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:41.690
you gotta sample the appetizer, Bile-sama!

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:44.430
Like I said,

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.560
I didn't come here to fight.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.900
Tablecloth...

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:08.520
Fly Net!

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.850
Fly Net,

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.920
the ultimate food cover!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.960
Escape is impossible!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.630
Sorry, Ichiryu.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:27.470
It seems this group's antsy to test the 
power of their activated Gourmet Cells.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.270
Activated Gourmet Cells...

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.640
Perhaps through the stolen 
Century Soup from Ice Hell

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:36.040
or after eating ingredients 
from the Gourmet World,

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.180
they gained considerable power?

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.960
That's it exactly!

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:53.360
What the...?

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.530
My body froze in midair...

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:01.900
What the hell...?!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:05.510
What?!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.120
Hey, you gotta be kiddin' me!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.960
He easily escaped the Tablecloth 
and Fly Net collaboration!

00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:31.030
You're not the former top 
of the world for nothing.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:35.230
You've gotten older, but your 
cells haven't lost their pizazz.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:39.070
Only, letting you move about 
freely past this point

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.770
would make us lose face,

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:45.840
so we'll do everything in our 
power to stop you, Ichiryu!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.290
Well, I tried.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:05.630
But since you insist, I guess 
I'll babysit you a little while.

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:35.890
My body's being pulled towards him!

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.400
The gravitational pull 
that Ichiryu possesses...

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:47.200
The force of the pull indicates the 
importance of the person's existence...

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:50.370
He's like a planet unto himself...

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.040
The gravitational pull is huge!

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:26.370
Well, well...

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:29.610
I didn't expect you to come out and greet me.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.850
Is it "good manners begin 
with a full stomach"?

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.890
Boss!

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.380
You've aged, old man!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.650
How many decades has it been, Midora?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.930
You never change.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:22.660
What do you want, old fool?

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:27.270
Don't tell me you came here to battle me?

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.800
Perish the thought.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:32.940
I only came to invite you to a meal.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.640
Well?

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.380
Shall we dine together again?

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:41.610
Little brother...

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.690
Say...

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.590
Remember the Cape of Food's End?

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:57.500
That memorable place where 
you, me, and Jiro trained.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.470
I've got a delicious feast set up there.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.830
You gotta be hungry, right?

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.340
Let's eat together.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.710
What's on your mind?

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:12.640
Are you looking for resolution 
with me, old man?!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:23.350
You won't call me "big bro" anymore?

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:29.960
For both Acacia-sama and Froese-sama,

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:35.030
the one they doted on the 
most was you, Midora...

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:40.340
Those nostalgic days feel 
like yesterday to me...

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.410
You know, Midora,

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:48.580
if possible, I hope that 
we can eat GOD together.

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:58.460
That's one wish that's not coming true.

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:01.020
I'm going to possess GOD.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.790
You don't mean to share it?

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.860
A monopoly!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.930
It'll result in war.

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:13.170
You're just now realizing that?

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:20.040
I see...

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:24.910
I wanted to sit down and have 
one last long talk with you,

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.520
but I guess it's not to be.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:31.250
Then if you're done here, get lost...

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.520
...before you get killed.

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:36.120
Take a hike!

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.960
I'm so scared!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.070
I'm sorry for causing a commotion.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.970
But this old fool is on his way out.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.300
Boss!

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:50.470
Are you sure we should just 
let him go like this?!

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.740
This is our chance to off the old man!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.940
Oh, that's right...

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.210
Everyone in the Gourmet Corp...

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:00.180
If it does come to war...

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:06.250
...I'm not going to be this good-natured.

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:08.520
Be careful.

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.810
Until then,

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.980
let's all enjoy the remainder 
of our lives as much as we can.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:40.920
He can still make that face?

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.590
Big bro...

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:52.830
Hey! Hey!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.330
B-Boss!

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.200
What should we do?!

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:17.610
I see...

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:22.080
So he wouldn't even listen 
to you... Stupid Midora...

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:25.150
Sorry for suddenly calling you here, Setsuno.

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:28.820
What are you acting so formal for, Ichi-chan?

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:33.300
Anyway, it would've been an important 
discussion for them, too...

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.460
Ah, well...

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:39.300
We'll never sit down at the same table again.

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.570
The future, as always, is entrusted to

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.670
those who sit down at one table.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.250
Like them...

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:02.660
When was the last time 
I saw him eat this much?

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:06.860
He must intend to charge up his 
body with ingredients to the max.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.930
I've got a feeling all hell 
is going to break loose.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:15.100
Midora must have developed 
more than we imagined.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.040
Setsuno!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:19.170
Your cooking has never been better.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:21.240
What can I say?

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:33.720
If I grate a whole Shock Lemon with 
its peel on and use just a little,

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:35.890
I'm told it'll make for 
an interesting texture!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.560
First, I sprinkle a little on the ingredient,

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:41.930
then cut off the skin of this orange

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.700
that's as soft as meringue, Oraingue...

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:48.870
Take this piping hot syrup 
that's made from the honey

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:52.240
of a Honey Dragon and Summer 
Whiskey, and pour it on...

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:59.880
Here you are, a honey crepe with 
grated Shock Lemon on the side.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.550
Chef Komatsu...

00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:10.490
I thought you were taking another extended 
leave, but you were at a casino?!

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.160
For goodness sake!

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.090
I won't stand for it this time...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.030
Chef Komatsu...

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:16.100
Yummy!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:18.200
Manager...

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:24.200
At the Gourmet Casino, I got a tip on 
using the peeled skin of ingredients,

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.140
so I wanted to try it out.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.840
So, what were you saying?

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:36.050
That's a wonderful way to use ingredients.

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:37.980
Thank you!

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.580
Delicious!

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.420
This is the best!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:46.420
Thanks to Toriko, who let me cook with 
the training ingredients he captured!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.760
From now, I've got to 
improve my skill even more!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.040
Alright!

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:10.210
Shall I take a look around for a hint 
to the sixth training ingredient?

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:29.130
In those younger days,

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:31.030
No matter how you chased them,

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:35.610
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.940
After that, time passed

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:41.410
Were you able to grasp

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:46.050
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:49.750
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:54.990
You turn into a coward,

00:20:56.290 --> 00:21:00.460
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:05.330
So now's the time!

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:13.010
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:17.250
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.320
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:24.150
Because we can't catch 'em

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:27.960
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:31.890
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:36.130
We're going to use a camera 
later, so get yours ready!

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:40.230
Please choose one of these three platters.

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:44.970
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:48.910
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.540
Alright, here we go!

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.080
A heaping helping...

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:55.250
Open!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.750
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:07.030
C - Broccotree Capture Level 34

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:03.420
...yours if you chose C!

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:07.230
I have a feeling something good will 
happen and it'll make the whole day fun!

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:15.870
B - Ganghood Capture Level 15

00:22:07.690 --> 00:22:11.130
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.830
Your special skill will help someone out,

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:15.940
and you'll probably get 
lots of luck in return!

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:24.380
A - Gegon Capture Level 11

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:19.840
And I'm sorry. If you chose A, you're third.

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:24.340
Don't be stubborn. The key to 
good fortune is an honest heart.

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:28.450
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:30.250
Are you ready?

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:33.020
One of Toriko's friends will 
appear with some words of wisdom.

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:38.560
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:35.190
If you take a photo of the scene,

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:38.560
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:40.360
Alright, here we go!

00:22:40.930 --> 00:22:44.700
3... 2... 1... Scoop chance!

00:22:45.730 --> 00:22:47.030
With ingredients...

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:49.270
...and Gourmet Luck...

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:53.170
...you should step forward 
and stock up on it yourself!

00:22:54.670 --> 00:22:57.910
For both Tom-san and myself, stocking 
up on info is the whole game.

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:03.180
And now, let's stock up on 
info for next week's episode!

00:23:04.180 --> 00:23:05.180
Take a look!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:07.550
What?!

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:08.960
Toriko is worried?

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:13.860
Let's ask Master Monchy, the fortune-telling sushi craftsman, for a big portion of advice!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:17.590
Hidden Training Ingredient! Emergency Instruction from Ichiryu!

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:19.430
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
